OL,3,GNEWSAMore than one in three children
OL,4,Aliving in poverty
OL,5,
OL,6,F"While the WMCA's diverse and youthful
OL,7,Fpopulation brings significant strengths
OL,8,Fand opportunities, these sit alongside
OL,9,Fdeepb@Qrooted inequalities that
OL,10,Fcontinue to affect people's life
OL,11,Fchances from early childhood onwards,"
OL,12,Fthe report said.
